# Nova Kestrel and Nova Kane both abbreviate to "Nova K." — the checksum's arithmetic
# balances perfectly both times (6+8=14, 9+3=12) but the subject can't be resolved to one roster
# name, so the equation must be discarded rather than merged into either player's running total.
# Two occurrences with differing rolls would otherwise be exactly enough to auto-bind.

